<header>
<h1>B737NG Air Conditioning Fault Summaries</h1>
<p>ATA 21-31 Cabin Pressurization Control · ATA 21-62 Pack/Zone Temperature Control</p>
<p>English summaries of the requested maintenance messages, organized by FIM task and the six requested fields.</p>
</header>
<main>
<div class="note"><strong>Use the approved manual for maintenance.</strong> These summaries are navigation and briefing aids; they do not replace the applicable FIM, AMM, aircraft effectivity, or required safety precautions. Connector pin checks, access steps, and effectivity-specific variations are abbreviated.</div>
<div class="tools"><input id="search" type="search" placeholder="Filter by message, task, component, or fault detail…" aria-label="Filter fault summaries"><button id="expand" type="button">Expand all</button><button id="collapse" type="button">Collapse all</button><span id="count" class="small">35 message entries</span></div>
