p("CAB PRESS CON CAB RATE HI","818","Reports a high rate of cabin-altitude change.","Outflow valve V48 or DCPC No. 1/No. 2.","SSM/WDM 21-31-22 and 21-31-23; Airplane Pack Operation Confidence Check, AMM 21-00-05-780-801; Engine Bleed Air System Health Check, AMM 36-11-00-700-801.","For specified controller part numbers, inspect copper edge tape and run DCPC BITE; review any additional messages or Code 30 history.","Replace the outflow valve and retest; if the message persists, replace the controller reporting the fault and repeat BITE. Investigate pack/bleed performance where history or flight symptoms indicate it."),
