p("CAB PRESS CON DADC #2 INVALID","807","The DCPC reports invalid data from ADIRU 2.","ADIRU 2, M1752, or wiring.","SSM/WDM 21-31-24.","Run DCPC BITE Task 801. If the message clears, treat as intermittent; if it remains, continue with ADIRU BITE.","Run ADIRS BITE on ADIRU 2 and correct any ADIRS messages. If none are reported, inspect wiring between both pressure controllers and ADIRU 2; repair and retest."),
p("CAB PRESS CON DRV ENBL ERROR","819","Reports a drive-enable signal problem for the pressure-control system.","DCPC No. 1, M1653, or No. 2, M1654.","SSM/WDM 21-31-22.","For specified controller part numbers, inspect copper edge tape and run BITE on both controllers. If the message clears, treat as intermittent.","Replace the controller that reports the fault, then run BITE on both controllers to confirm the message is cleared."),
