p("CAB PRESS CON OFV OR WIRING","805","Reports a possible outflow-valve or valve-circuit wiring fault.","Outflow valve V48 or wiring.","SSM/WDM 21-31-22 and 21-31-23.","Run DCPC BITE Task 801. If the message clears, treat as intermittent; if it remains, continue.","Replace the outflow valve and retest. If the message persists, inspect wiring between the indicated controller and valve, repair as needed, then repeat BITE."),
p("CAB PRESS CON SEL PNL LRU FAIL","803","The index routes this message to Task 803, covering abnormal pressure-control module/selector-panel displays and valve-position indication.","Control module P5-6; connectors D10724/D10726; dual AUTO FAIL indication; controller power loss or delayed transfer; panel power loss; inter-unit communication/wiring; wiring to V48; or outflow-valve fault.","SDS 21-30-00; SSM/WDM 21-31-11 through 21-31-25.","Confirm expected FLT ALT/LAND ALT values, responsive display/faceplate lighting, and fully open outflow-valve indication on the ground. Perform display/lighting checks and branch by symptom.","Use the symptom-specific path for blank/dim, 88888/dashes, scrambled/frozen or limited-value displays, backlighting faults, or a stuck/nonmoving valve pointer. Check panel power, lighting, connectors, and signal wiring; repair/replace the faulty component and verify operation."),
